    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d184">

                <pb facs="0226" n="216" sameAs="frus:frus1943v01/pg216"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">840.48 Refugees/4722: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Ambassador in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Harriman</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-11-10T20:00:00-04:00">November 10,
                            1943—8 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1191. With reference to Department’s number 1039, October 20. Large number
                    refugees in Sweden and Switzerland make it urgent <pb facs="0227" n="217"
                        xml:id="pg217"/> to announce proposed joint declaration on repatriation in
                    near future. Other countries have not been informed of proposed declaration
                    pending Soviet Government’s acceptance. You are requested to discuss this with
                    Soviet authorities at earliest appropriate date and endeavor to secure their
                    acceptance.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Stettinius</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
